{"id":"df600eb9-cf4c-4a2e-a91f-ce9a59941fd4","title":"Fluid Pastels 1","slug":"fluid-pastels-1","collectionSlug":"fluid-pastels","collectionName":"Fluid Pastels","category":"background","categoryZh":"背景动画","description":"A smooth, gradient-based shader effect transitioning from purple on the left side to light blue on the right side. The gradient flows diagonally from the upper-left to lower-right, creating a soft, ethereal atmosphere. The Swirl component establishes the primary color gradient using stops at #9ed1f8 (light blue) and #625ac5 (purple), blended at 50% opacity. A FractalNoise layer with 40% opacity and softLight blending mode adds subtle texture and depth variation across the surface, creating gentle undulations and organic variation without harsh contrast. The CursorRipples component introduces interactive distortion with high intensity (17.4) and moderate decay (3.3), creating concentric wave patterns that respond to cursor movement. The Watercolor effect with high bleed (2.9) and minimal paper texture (0.07) adds a fluid, diffused quality that softens edges and creates a watercolor-like bleeding effect. The overall composition has a dreamy, meditative quality with smooth color transitions, minimal hard edges, and a balanced blend of static gradient with dynamic interactive elements. The tone mapping set to cineon enhances the color depth and cinematic quality of the gradient.","colors":["#9ed1f8","#625ac5","#1275d8","#fbf7ec"],"labels":["gradient","organic","textured","calm"],"cover":"/shaders/covers/df600eb9-cf4c-4a2e-a91f-ce9a59941fd4.jpg","toneMapping":"cineon","components":[{"type":"Swirl","id":"idmrwh8u6hvgbn3rwjx","_key":"key_mrwh8u6hvgbn3rwjx","props":{"blend":50,"speed":1,"stops":[{"color":"#9ed1f8","position":0},{"color":"#625ac5","position":1}],"colorA":"#1275d8","colorB":"#e19136","detail":0.6,"opacity":1,"maskType":"alpha","blendMode":"normal","transform":{"edges":"transparent","scale":1,"anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0